*(map-left
<div id="datacenter_left_col">
  <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
    <span id="datacenter_title">Simple Map Search</span>
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="../handyref">Handy reference</a> for determining what 
    are the most current maps and for understanding the content of 
    the various Neighbors maps. 
  </p>
  <p>
    If you are looking for <span style="font-weight:bold">particular map markers</span>,
    use the <span style="font-weight:bold"><a href="locus">locus search</a></span>.
  </p>
  <div id="datacenter_gray_background">
    <p>
      This search form allows you to just enter a name or partial name to quickly retrieve 
      the desired map.
      <br>
      
      *(simple-search-instructions #load: templates/data_center/simple_search_instructions.bau#)
      
    </p>
    <div name="button_container" class="button_container">
      <form  name="n1" method="get" action="javascript:getSearchData('map', 'simple_results', document.getElementById('term'\).value\);" class="tiny">
        <input type="text" name="term" id="term" size="20" value="$(term)" class="quick_search">
        <input type="submit" name="button"  value="Submit" class="button">
        (see a <a href="#" onClick="document.getElementById('term'\).value = 'UMC 98';">sample map query</a>\)<br>
        @(limits
          *(adjust_limits #load: templates/data_center/set_search_limit.bau#)
        )
      </form>
    </div>
    <script type="text/javascript">
        document.n1.term.focus(\);
    </script>
    <p>
      Another interesting search is <span style="font-weight:bold;">SSR</span>
      (finds maps assembled using SSRs\)
    </p>
    <br>
    <div id='simple_results'></div>
    
    @(start-search #display:off#
      <script language="javascript">
        getSearchData('map', 'simple_results', '$(term)'\);
      </script>
    )
  </div>
  <br>
  
  <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
    <span id="datacenter_title">Advanced Map Search</span>
  </p>
  <p>
    Are you looking for <a href="../bin_viewer">core bin markers</a>?
  </p>
  <div id="datacenter_lite_green_background">
    <table CELLPADDING=6 CELLSPACING=4 BORDER=0 WIDTH="100%" 
      summary="A table within which you can review your search criteria.">
      <tr>
        <td WIDTH="100%"  VALIGN="TOP" CLASS="small">
          <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
            <span id="datacenter_title">Set Up Search Criteria</span>
          </p>
          <p>
            Check the boxes next to the fields you want to search; by setting a
            criterion, the box will be checked for you.  Only checked boxes will
            have that criterion evaluated.
          </p>
          <form method="get" action="javascript: map_adv_search('adv_results'\);" 
            style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px;">
            <input type="hidden" name="query" value="true">
            <input type="checkbox" id="box1" name="use1" value="true"> 
            <label for="box1">Show only maps</label> that contain 
            <label for="locus1box">this locus</label> 
            <input type="text" size="10" maxlength="20" name="locus1box" 
              id="locus1box" class="small" onchange="document.getElementById(\'box1\'\).checked = true;">
            (for example, you could find maps with 
            <a href="#" onClick="document.getElementById(\'locus1box\'\).value = \'kn1\'; document.getElementById(\'box1\'\).checked = true;">kn1</a>\)&nbsp;(AND\)
            <br>
            <input type="checkbox" id="box2" name="use2" value="true"> 
            <label for="box2">Show only maps</label> that contain 
            <label for="locus2box">this locus</label> 
            <input type="text" size="10" maxlength="20" name="locus2box"
            id="locus2box" class="small" onchange="document.getElementById(\'box2\'\).checked = true;"> 
            (for example, you could find maps with 
            <a href="#" onClick="document.getElementById(\'locus2box\'\).value = \'tub1\'; document.getElementById(\'box2\'\).checked = true;">tub1</a>\)&nbsp;(AND\)
            <br>
            <input type="checkbox" id="box3" name="use3" value="true"> 
            <label for="box3">Show only maps</label> that contain 
            <label for="locus3box">this locus</label> 
            <input type="text" size="10" maxlength="20" name="locus3box" 
            id="locus3box" class="small" onchange="document.getElementById(\'box3\'\).checked = true;">
            <br>
            <input type="checkbox" id="box4" name="use4" value="true"> 
            <label for="box4">Show only maps</label> of <label for="chrom">this chromosome</label>:
            <select name="chrom" id="chrom" class="small" onchange="document.getElementById(\'box4\'\).checked = true;">
              $(lg_options)
            </select>
            <br>
            <input type="checkbox" id="box5" name="use5" value="true">
            <label for="box5">Show only maps</label> from 
            <label for="source">this source</label>: 
            <select name="source" id="source" class="small" onchange="document.getElementById(\'box5\'\).checked = true;">
              $(sources)
            </select>
            <br>
            <input type="checkbox" id="box6" name="use6" value="true"> 
            <label for="box6">Show only maps</label> from 
            <label for="panel">this mapping panel</label>: 
            <select name="panel" id="panel" class="small" onchange="document.getElementById(\'box6\'\).checked = true;">
              $(panels)
            </select>
            <br><br>        
            <input type="button" class="button" id="submit" value="Submit" onclick="javascript:map_adv_search('adv_results'\);">&nbsp;
            <input type="button" class="button" id="clear" value="Clear" onclick="javascript:this.form.reset(\);">
            @(adv_limits
              *(adv_adjust_limits #load: templates/data_center/set_adv_search_limit.bau#)
            )
          </form>
          
          <div id="adv_results"></div>
        </td>
     </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
  <br>
  <p style="margin-bottom: 8px;">
    <span id="datacenter_title">Map Reports & Tools</span>
  </p>
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight:bold;"><a href="/snpversity">SNPversity</a></span>: 
    This tool allows you to search for SNPs and compare them in thousands of inbred lines. 
  </p>
  <p> 
    <span style="font-weight:bold;"><a href="../incongruency">Incongruencies between B73 RefGen_v2 and ISU Integrated IBM 2009 map </a></span>:
    This tool lists loci that are placed on B73 RefGen_v2 by sequence similarity 
    (via BLAST\),and compares that position to their predicted genomic position based on their
    genetic position on the ISU Integrated IBM 2009 map.
  </p><br>
  <p> 
    A list of all maps can be found here: 
    (chromosome  
    <a href="javascript:full_list_1(\);">1</a>
    <a href="javascript:full_list_2(\);">2</a> 
    <a href="javascript:full_list_3(\);">3</a> 
    <a href="javascript:full_list_4(\);">4</a>
    <a href="javascript:full_list_5(\);">5</a>
    <a href="javascript:full_list_6(\);">6</a>
    <a href="javascript:full_list_7(\);">7</a> 
    <a href="javascript:full_list_8(\);">8</a>
    <a href="javascript:full_list_9(\);">9</a>
    <a href="javascript:full_list_10(\);">10</a> 
    \)
  </p><br>
  <p>Here are some of the more popular complete maps.</p>
  <p><b><u>Consensus maps</u></b></p>
  <p style="margin-top:5px; margin-left:14px;">
    <span style="font-weight:bold">Genetic</span> (lg. 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1203637">1</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1203638">2</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1203639">3</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1203640">4</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1203641">5</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1203642">6</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1203643">7</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1203644">8</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1203645">9</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1203646">10</a>\)
    <br>
    <span style="font-weight:bold">IBM Neighbors</span> (lg. 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=754720">1</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=754721">2</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=754722">3</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=754723">4</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=754724">5</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=754725">6</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=754726">7</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=754727">8</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=754728">9</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=754729">10</a>\): 
    Genes placed by recombinational and physical data.
  </p>
  <br>
  <p><b><u>High resolution maps</u></b></p>
  <p style="margin-top:5px; margin-left:10px;">
    <b>Mixed Markers (RFLP, SSR, SNP, INDEL\):</b>
  </p>
    <p style="margin-top:5px; margin-left:20px;">

    <span style="font-weight:bold">IBM2</span> (chrom. 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=870745">1</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=870746">2</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=870747">3</a>
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=870748">4</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=870749">5</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=870750">6</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=870751">7</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=870752">8</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=870753">9</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=870754">10</a>\):
    Intermated B73/Mo17, a high resolution genetic map
    <br>
    <span style="font-weight:bold">IBM GNP2004</span> (chrom. 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954207">1</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954208">2</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954209">3</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954210">4</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954211">5</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954212">6</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954213">7</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954214">8</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954215">9</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954216">10</a>\):
    Genetic map from Genoplante.
    <br>

    <span style="font-weight:bold">ISU Integrated IBM 2009</span> (chrom. 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1233730">1</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1233731">2</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1233732">3</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1233733">4</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1233734">5</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1233735">6</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1233736">7</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1233737">8</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1233738">9</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1233739">10</a>\)
    <br>
    <span style="font-weight:bold">LHRF Gnp2004</span> (chrom. 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954374">1</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954375">2</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954376">3</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954377">4</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954378">5</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954379">6</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954380">7</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954381">8</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954382">9</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=954383">10</a>\):
    High-resolution genetic map from Genoplante.
    <br>

    <span style="font-weight:bold">NAM  </span> (chrom. 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1160762">1</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1160763">2</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1160764">3</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1160765">4</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1160766">5</a>
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1160767">6</a>
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1160768">7</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1160769">8</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1160770">9</a> 
    <a href="/data_center/map?id=1160771">10</a>\):
    Nested Association Mapping (NAM\) for maize<br>
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top:5px; margin-left: 10px; font-weight: bold;">
    SNP - MaizeSNP50 array based:
    </p>
    <p style="margin-top:5px; margin-left:20px;">
        <span style="font-weight:bold">IBM MaizeSNP50</span> (chrom. 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776662">1</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776663">2</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776664">3</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776665">4</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776666">5</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776667">6</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776668">7</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776669">8</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776670">9</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776671">10</a>\)
        <br>
        <span style="font-weight:bold">LHRF MaizeSNP50</span> (chrom. 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776672">1</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776673">2</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776674">3</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776675">4</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776676">5</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776677">6</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776678">7</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776679">8</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776680">9</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=2776681">10</a>\)
        <br>
         <span style="font-weight:bold">Cornfed Dent Composite</span> (chrom. 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133142">1</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133143">2</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133144">3</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133145">4</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133146">5</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133147">6</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133148">7</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133149">8</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133150">9</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133151">10</a>\)
        <br>
        <span style="font-weight:bold">Cornfed Flint Composite</span> (chrom. 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3094852">1</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133133">2</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133134">3</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133135">4</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133136">5</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133141">6</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133137">7</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133138">8</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133139">9</a> 
        <a href="/data_center/map?id=3133140">10</a>\)
        <br>
    </p>
     
  
  <br>
  <p>
    <b>Physical Map</b>:
    View information about the physical map from the 
    <a href="https://archive.maizegdb.org/documentation/maizemap/index.php">Maize Mapping Project</a>.
    <br>
    <span style="font-weight:bold"><a href="/data_center/cytogenetic#rn-maps">Recombination Nodule Maps</a></span>:
    Map containing data on the distribution of recombination nodules along 
    pachytene synaptonemal complexes can be used to predict cytological locations
    of genetically mapped loci and vice versa using the 
    Morgan2McClintock Translator
    <!-- 2026-09-07: the Morgan2McClintock link was removed. dill-picl.org was
         re-registered 2025-06-21 and now serves a gambling site; the m2m
         subdomain is NXDOMAIN. The tool is named but not linked. -->
    <br>
  </p>
  <br>
  <p>
    <span id="datacenter_title">Map Score Downloads</span>
    <br><br>
    <span style="text-decoration:underline;">IBM 94 population</span> 
    <a href="/mapscore_ibmlist">list of lines</a>, 
    <a href="/mapscore_ibmscore"> cIBM map scores</a> (on-frame only\), 
    <a href="/mapscore_ibm94genoscore">IBM GNP 2004 map scores</a> (complete set\),
    and a <a href="$(root_link)/docs/ibm94mm.txt">MapMaker infile</a> (which includes all markers
    in MaizeGDB that have been mapped using the IBM 94 population and also 
    includes the ISU-IBM Map4 IDP markers\).
    <br>
    <span style="text-decoration:underline;">IBM 302 population</span> 
    <a href="/mapscore_ibm302list">list of lines</a>, 
    <a href="/mapscore_ibm302score">map scores</a>, and 
    <a href="/data_center/qtl-data">QTL Cartographer files</a>.
  </p>
  <br>
</div>
)
